=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_9f4b — Weekend snack bowl: coffee table at 21, couch at 22

On weekend evenings the snack bowl follows a different path than on weekdays. The weekday documents (p_a3f7, p_c2f9, p_f1a6) all place it in the cupboard at 21–22.5 h, the "stored away during TV" pattern. But the Saturday evidence (day 4) shows the bowl at coffee_table_l1 at 21:00 (two sightings) and at couch_l1 at 22:00 (two sightings). This is the relaxed weekend-TV pattern: the bowl is out and within arm's reach, not tucked away. During the day it rests on the kitchen counter (its usual daytime spot), and it does not go to the cupboard until the next morning's cleanup.

What sets this apart: every other live document that covers the 21–22.5 h window puts the snack bowl in the cupboard. This document says it is on the coffee table (20–22 h) and then the couch (22–24 h) on weekends.

What would refute it: the snack bowl found in the cupboard at 21:00 or 22:00 on a Saturday or Sunday; the bowl on the coffee table at 21:00 on a weekday (which would break the weekday-cupboard pattern this document relies on for contrast).

No objects travel; the bowl stays in the house all day.

